FAQ SECTION
Label: Questions
Headline:
Straight Answers. No Fluff.

Q1: How fast can my system go live? Simple AI agents (WhatsApp, chatbot, social media) are typically live within 48–72 hours. More complex systems like trading bots or full operations pipelines take 1–3 weeks. We give you an exact timeline before we start.
Q2: Do I need technical knowledge to use my AI system? None. You interact with your system the same way you do today — through WhatsApp, email, or a simple dashboard we set up for you. We handle everything under the hood.
Q3: What happens if something breaks? We monitor all active systems. On monthly plans, we fix issues before you even notice them. If something unexpected happens, you reach us directly on WhatsApp — not a support ticket queue.
Q4: Can I start with just one service and add more later? Absolutely. Most clients start with one system (usually WhatsApp AI or the invoice bot), see the results in 30 days, and then expand. There's no obligation to commit to everything upfront.
Q5: How is this different from tools like ChatGPT or Zapier? Those are tools. We build systems. We connect, configure, and customize everything so it works specifically for your business — then we maintain it. You don't set up anything or figure out prompts. You just use the result.
Q6: What if my business processes change? That's what the monthly plan covers. When your business changes, we update the system. No extra charge for standard adjustments on Growth or Full Autopilot plans.
Q7: Is my business data safe? Yes. We don't store sensitive client data on our servers. All data lives in tools you already own (Notion, Airtable, Google Drive, etc.). We architect for privacy from day one.
Q8: How do I get started? Book a free 30-minute consultation — no pitch, no pressure. We look at your current processes, identify where AI saves you the most time, and tell you exactly what we'd build and what it would cost. Then you decide.


